Current Features:
Upload TXT, PDF, DOCX documents
Ask questions from uploaded documents
Get answers using Groq LLM
Show source chunks with similarity score
Clear database
Show stats
Works only from document content (doesn't make up answers)



Missing Features:
1. No Conversation Memory(Every question is independent. ChatGPT remembers the whole conversation.)
2. No General Knowledge(Your model only answers from uploaded documents.)
3. No Streaming(ChatGPT shows answers word by word. Your system shows everything at once.)
4.No File Management(Can't see, delete or manage uploaded documents.)
5. No Web Search(ChatGPT can search the internet. Your model can't.)